# NOTICE — SpeakSend runtime / third-party components

SpeakSend’s Swift Package (`Package.swift`) links Apple system frameworks.
原文富文本加粗/斜体由应用内 `SpeakSendMarkdownEditorView` 实现，不捆绑第三方编辑器 SDK。

The distribution package does not bundle Whisper, Ollama, or model weights.
SpeakSend first reuses compatible user/system runtimes. It downloads a managed
runtime only after the user explicitly requests a corresponding local model.

| Component | Role | Typical location / source |
|-----------|------|---------------------------|
| Apple Speech / AVFoundation | Default on-device dictation | System frameworks |
| whisper.cpp `whisper-cli`, ggml, LLVM OpenMP | Optional local Whisper delivery | On-demand runtime under `~/Library/Application Support/SpeakSend/runtime/whisper/` plus user-requested `~/.cache/whisper-models/` weights |
| Qwen3-ASR / MLX Audio | Optional local ASR | User-requested weights under `~/models/Qwen3-ASR-*`; on supported Macs, an on-demand managed runtime under `~/Library/Application Support/SpeakSend/runtime/qwen/`; legacy `~/venvs/qwen3-asr/` remains compatible |
| Ollama (local HTTP) | Optional structure / model catalog | Existing loopback service/system runtime, or user-triggered managed v0.33.1 runtime under `~/Library/Application Support/SpeakSend/runtime/ollama/v0.33.1/`; models remain in `~/.ollama` |

whisper.cpp and ggml are licensed under the MIT License. LLVM OpenMP is licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions. Their license texts are saved
beside the managed runtime when the user requests that runtime.

Sources:
https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/tree/main/openmp

The managed Qwen runtime is downloaded only after the user explicitly requests
a Qwen model. It uses pinned uv, CPython, MLX, mlx-audio, and Hugging Face Hub
components. Exact package versions and notices are written beside that runtime;
the DMG itself does not bundle them. Existing user-managed Qwen environments
remain outside SpeakSend's ownership.

